"Commercial Use" means any use intended for commercial advantage, monetization, business
operations, customer service, paid services, advertising, affiliate revenue, sponsorship, lead
generation, resale, or other revenue-generating activity.

"Public Hosted Service" means any website, SaaS, hosted application, bot, API, crawler service,
data service, directory, navigation site or similar service made available to third parties over
a network, whether access is paid or free.

"Competitive Service" means any Public Hosted Service that is the same as or substantially
similar to TGbox's product positioning, including Telegram channel, group and bot directories,
submission bots, navigation or search sites, and related data aggregation services.

2. Permitted Use

Subject to this license, you may:

- Read and study the source code.
- Copy and modify the source code for personal learning, research, evaluation and testing on
