3. Restrictions

Without prior written permission from the Licensor, you may not:

- Deploy, host or run TGbox, a modified version of TGbox, or a derivative work of TGbox as a
  Public Hosted Service, whether publicly accessible or open to any third party.
- Use TGbox for Commercial Use, including in a deployment that carries advertising, affiliate
  links, sponsored placements, paid listings, paid traffic routing, paid data access, paid
  membership or other monetization.
- Operate a Competitive Service based on TGbox or derived from it.
- Resell, rent, sublicense or offer TGbox as part of a commercial product or service.
- Distribute copies of TGbox, in whole or in part, other than by pull request to the official
  repository.
- Use TGbox as a substitute data feed, bulk mirror, crawler target or dataset backend for
  another product.
- Remove or hide copyright, license, attribution or official project notices.
- Present any fork, mirror, hosted copy, derivative work or modified version as the Official
  Service.

Forking this repository on GitHub, as GitHub's Terms of Service allow, grants none of the rights
above; a fork may only be viewed.

4. Brand, Data and Content

This license applies to the software code in this repository only. It does not grant any right
to use the TGbox name, logo, icon, domain names (including tgbox.cc), visual identity,
screenshots, or any of the following, except as the Licensor allows in writing:

