- collected channel and bot lists, raw or normalized data, crawl logs and stock or freshness data;
- manually reviewed classification results, user submissions, feedback and moderation notes;
- guides, editorial content and marketing copy.

You may not use the TGbox name or confusingly similar names for an unrelated service, present a
service as endorsed by TGbox, or register domains, accounts, packages or app names confusingly
similar to TGbox. The terms for the Official Service's data are at https://tgbox.cc/about/#terms.

